th=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/The_Society_of_Brilliance\">The Society of Brilliance</a></span>, followed by transcripts of ensuing meetings. Also featured: statements and testimonies of new members who have since joined.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201714\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1795/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35633/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9491/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936878/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.222      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   48.222      1 -total\n 57.59%   27.770      8 Template:Icon_text\n 51.61%   24.886     19 Template:Trim\n 23.97%   11.560      2 Template:Uid\n 15.20%    7.330      3 Template:Icon_link\n 13.32%    6.423      2 Template:Template_style\n 13.28%    6.404      1 Template:Main_only\n  9.68%    4.668      8 Template:Ifempty\n  9.20%    4.436      1 Template:Ifexist\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31692-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201714 and revision id 321362. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}